<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">Chola Empire</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Chola, Cholas</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Chola Empire was a Tamil dynasty of southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/india">India</a> that reached its height in the eleventh century. It built a powerful navy and extended its influence across the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bay-of-bengal">Bay of Bengal</a>. Its raids on the ports of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/srivijaya">Srivijaya</a> in the eleventh century severely weakened the Srivijaya Empire's control of maritime trade.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/chola-empire.jpg" alt="Chola Empire" width="320" height="188" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Nikel3012 · CC0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chola_Empire_Map_(1).svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
